from recently, please?\", \"Actually, never mind, thank you anyway.\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w36-0006\", \"v\": [[\"Could you tell me who I currently owe money to, please?\", \"I phoned the first one earlier. Would you log that for me, please?\", \"I'm sorry, that was the wrong one. I meant the third one.\", \"Could you show me the debts I have with them, please?\", \"Would you mind showing me the photos I took last week?\"], [\"I've been meaning to get my finances straight, so who am I actually in debt to at the moment?\", \"Right, I rang the first one this morning to sort things out, so can you log that call for me?\", \"Oh hang on, I've mixed them up, it wasn't that one at all, it was the third one I called.\", \"While I'm thinking about money anyway, what are the debts between me and them looking like?\", \"Different thing — I want to put together a little album for the family, so can you pull up the photos I took last week?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w36-0007\", \"v\": [[\"I'm seeing her later and want to be sure I'm not forgetting anything, so is there anything about Tiziana in my to-dos?\", \"Okay, and while I'm tidying things up around the house, what about alcove?\", \"I'm trying to figure out whether I've got any free time this weekend, so what's planned for saturday?\", \"Honestly that's way too much for one day, I'm going to be wiped out, so can you shift all of them to next monday?\"], [\"any Tiziana stuff in my to-dos\", \"what about alcove\", \"whats planned for saturday\", \"move all of them to next monday pls\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w36-0008\", \"v\": [[\"I met Flavia for coffee today. Could you log that for me, please?\", \"Before I pick, could you tell me when I last spoke with the Clough one?\", \"Thank you. It was the caretaker one, please log it for her.\"], [\"Had a lovely catch-up this afternoon, so could you log that I had Flavia over for coffee today?\", \"Hmm, I'm not sure — remind me, when did I last speak with the Clough one? That might jog my memory.\", \"Ah right, then it wasn't her. It was the one who's our caretaker, log it against her instead.\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w36-0009\", \"v\": [[\"I'm trying to keep better track of who I've been seeing lately, so could you log that I met Flavia Geazaby for coffee today?\", \"Would you please log that I had a coffee with Flavia Geazaby today? Thank you.\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w36-0010\", \"v\": [[\"I need to sort out childcare around it, so what day is the lighthouse fitting on again?\", \"hmm ok whats everything else on that day\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w36-0012\", \"v\": [[\"photos of Kaito Scrivener\", \"wait — Montreux Bridge shots?\", \"back to Kaito's — who's in it?\"], [\"My friend's birthday is coming up and I want to make something for him, so could you show me photos of Kaito Scrivener?\", \"Oh hang on, before I forget, I've been wanting to look back at the shots from Montreux Bridge, can you pull those up quickly?\", \"Okay, going back to the photo of Kaito that we were looking at before, who's actually in it besides him?\"]]}","ttft_ms":10683,"type":"result","duration_ms":28892,"uuid":"d177e22f-c217-40cd-8eb9-73d8f043248b","ttft_stream_ms":1665,"time_to_request_ms":153,"first_content_frame_ms":1665,"time_to_request_from_spawn_ms":22519978,"warm_spare_claimed":false,"time_origin_ms":1790279070538.3955,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
